  "solution": "**Logic: Second no. = [(First no. + Third no.) × 2]**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**4 - 18 - 5 →**\n\n⇒ [(4 + 5) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (9 × 2) = 18\n\n**7 - 20 - 3 →**\n\n⇒ [(7 + 3) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (10 × 2) = 20\n\nChecking the given options:\n\n**(1)** 6 - 16 - 2 →\n\n⇒ [(6 + 2) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (8 × 2) =** 16**\n\n**(2) **7 - 12 - 8 →\n\n⇒ [(7 + 8) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (15 × 2) = 30\n\n**(3)** 8 - 11 - 3 →\n\n⇒ [(8 + 3) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (11 × 2) = 22\n\n**(4)** 5 - 21 - 8 →\n\n⇒ [(5 + 8) × 2]\n\n​⇒ (13 × 2) = 26\n\nHere, **'****6 - 16 - 2' **is similar to the given number pairs.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".\n\n59:Td57,\n&",
